        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n\n\n\n<hr>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 137 supports the <code class=\"notranslate\">view-transition-name</code> property's <code class=\"notranslate\">match-element</code> value. See <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5098745710247936\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5098745710247936</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Adds information on the new value to the <code class=\"notranslate\">view-transition-name</code> reference page and rewrites the page to provide better structure.</li>\n<li>Updates the relevant \"Using...\" guide to add appropriate mentions of the new property value, and improves the structure.</li>\n<li>Updates the API landing page to link to my new <code class=\"notranslate\">match-element</code> demo, which is being added to <code class=\"notranslate\">dom-examples</code> via <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3110608092\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/dom-examples/issues/311\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/dom-examples/pull/311/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/dom-examples/pull/311\">mdn/dom-examples#311</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n",
